  <!-- EN: hound drone pack -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackHound.label>猎犬部署背包</DMS_Apparel_PackHound.label>
  <!-- EN: A container and assembly kit for carrying and deploying remote-controlled  hound drones, capable of quickly deploying a Hound drone in combat and acting as a remote-controlled base station to control and recover the drone. -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackHound.description>用於在战斗中携带和部署猎犬无人机的大号背包，并能够作为遥控基站来指挥和回收无人机。</DMS_Apparel_PackHound.description>
  <!-- EN: drone -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackHound.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>无人机</DMS_Apparel_PackHound.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
