  <DMS_Apparel_PackHound.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>准备中</DMS_Apparel_PackHound.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: hound drone pack -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackHound.verbs.Verb_Deploy.label>部署猎犬</DMS_Apparel_PackHound.verbs.Verb_Deploy.label>
  
  <!-- EN: verlingbrid drone belt -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.label>桨鸟部署腰带</DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.label>
  <!-- EN: A remote controller and assembly module for deploying verlingbrid drones, capable deploying drones in combat and acting as a remote-controlled base station to control the drones. -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.description>用於在战斗中携带和部署桨鸟无人机的遥控器和组装模组，并能够作为遥控基站来指挥和回收无人机。</DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.description>
  <!-- EN: drone -->
  <DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>无人机</DMS_Apparel_PackVerling.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
